1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,266
I Love eating ice cream
我喜欢吃冰淇淋

2
00:00:01,272 --> 00:00:02,545
Ice cream comes in many flavors
冰淇淋有很多种口味

3
00:00:02,545 --> 00:00:04,225
and my favorite is strawberry
我最喜欢的是草莓味的。

4
00:00:04,392 --> 00:00:06,392
Eating ice cream in the summer is the best
夏天吃冰淇淋是最好的

5
00:00:06,392 --> 00:00:07,905
because it cools me down
因为它让我冷静下来

6
00:00:07,953 --> 00:00:08,791
Sometimes
有时

7
00:00:08,792 --> 00:00:10,865
I go to the ice cream shop with my family
我和家人一起去冰淇淋店

8
00:00:10,872 --> 00:00:13,465
and everyone chooses their favorite flavor
每个人都选择自己喜欢的口味

9
00:00:13,553 --> 00:00:15,146
Ice cream is not only delicious
冰淇淋不仅好吃

10
00:00:15,153 --> 00:00:16,705
but also makes me happy
但也让我开心

11
00:00:16,952 --> 00:00:18,192
Every time I eat ice cream
每次我吃冰淇淋的时候

12
00:00:18,193 --> 00:00:19,442
it's a joyful moment
这是一个快乐的时刻

